<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 32.35 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 32.35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell 19.50 basis points to 32.3500 percent on Friday from 32.5450 percent on Thursday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is revised weekly.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9558</p>
